==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|tafele}}, from {{etyl|la|nl}} {{m|la|tabula||board}}. Doublet with Dutch {{m|nl|tabel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=nl|/ˈtaːfəl/}}
* {{audio|Nl-tafel.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|f|-s|pl2=-@en|tafeltje}}

# {{l|en|table}} (item of furniture)
# {{label|nl|metonymy}} a {{l|en|meal}}, {{l|en|spread}} on (a) table(s)
# {{label|nl|arithmetic}} {{l|en|multiplication table}}
# a writing {{l|en|tablet}}

====Usage notes====
The plural {{m|nl||tafelen}} is only used in the sense "writing tablet".

